SUMMARY:Second Saturday Garden Tour
DESCRIPTION:Join one of our volunteer Garden Guides on the second Saturday of the month for a casual\, one-hour guided tour of the North Carolina Botanical Garden. Discover the Garden’s native plant gardens and conservation mission while enjoying seasonal highlights\, from spring wildflowers to fall color. Space is limited! \nFee: $6 ($5 Members) \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncbg.unc.edu/event/second-saturday-garden-tour-2/
